From c5f82a13e863a9b9da26466947e3bf7cfa5a9227 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: junhuizhang-boop <junhui.zhang@novita.ai>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 15:10:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ci: harden guarded historical benchmark publication replay
 (#235)

* ci: add guarded historical benchmark publication replay

Download a pinned Actions artifact on a GitHub-hosted runner, validate its identity and admission inputs, and perform a writer-scoped publication with strict base and post-push verification. Add an expected-base guard to the shared sync script to reject races before commit.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex

Signed-off-by: Junhui Zhang <junhui.zhang@novita.ai>

* ci: harden historical publication replay

Bind replay to the reviewed source run and benchmark packet, retry controller fetches, and keep writer credentials out of child environments.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex

Signed-off-by: Junhui Zhang <junhui.zhang@novita.ai>

---------

Signed-off-by: Junhui Zhang <junhui.zhang@novita.ai>
